
What is an API document? What are the popular documentation formats?
========================================================
→ An API document describes how to use an API, including endpoints, request and response formats, and authentication details.
Popular API Documentation Formats / Tools
1️⃣ Swagger / OpenAPI (Most Popular)
Industry standard
Supports interactive UI
Auto-generated documentation
👉 Example tools:
Swagger UI
Swagger Editor
2️⃣ Postman Documentation
Created directly from Postman collections
Easy to share with teams
Good for testing + docs together
3️⃣ RAML (RESTful API Modeling Language)
YAML-based
Used to design APIs before development
Clear and structured
